{"id": "3117895", "revid": "309008", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3117895", "title": "China Airlines", "text": "China Airlines este o companie aerian\u0103 taiwanez\u0103. Este membr\u0103 a alian\u021bei SkyTeam.\nChina Airlines a fost \u00eenfiin\u021bat\u0103 \u00een Taipei \u00een anul 1959. \u00cen 1966, a oferit prima rut\u0103 interna\u021bional\u0103, un zbor de la Taipei la Saigon, azi Ho \u0218i Min, Vietnam."}
