{"id": "3118300", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3118300", "title": "Ia\u0219i Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu feminin", "text": "Ia\u0219i Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu feminin a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii iulie 2024. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Ia\u0219i, Rom\u00e2nia, disputat pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103, \u00een aer liber. Veronika Erjavec \u0219i Dalila Jakupovi\u0107 au fost campioanele \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar Erjavec nu particip\u0103 \u00een acest an. Jakupovi\u0107 a f\u0103cut pereche cu Bibiane Schoofs, dar au pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba Mirrei Andreeva \u0219i a Sofiei Lansere.\nAnna Danilina \u0219i Irina Khromacheva au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu feminin la Ia\u0219i Open 2024, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-le \u00een final\u0103 pe Alexandra Panova \u0219i Yana Sizikova, 6\u20134, 6\u20132."}
